# Storefront Quality Checks

After substantive changes, run:

```bash
npm run build:storefront
```

Or at minimum:

```bash
npm run check-types -w storefront
npm run lint -w storefront
```

Fix linter and type errors introduced by the change; do not leave broken builds.

## Dev commands

- Storefront only: `npm run dev:storefront` (http://localhost:3001)
- Both apps: `npm run dev`
- Vendure Shop API: http://localhost:3000/shop-api
